QuestGuidance.Register("en",265,{
[8449]="70061BBB\n1\tDefeat Wargs (total: 8)\030Defeat a Warg pack-leader\tFierce Wargs have claimed an area of Swanfleet, earning it the nickname 'Bloodhollow'. Marget has asked you for assistance in this task. Slay Wargs in Bloodhollow.\n2\tTalk to Marget\t\n",
[8450]="7006F08A\n1\tGather stories for Zamína (total: 5)\tZamína wishes to write a song honouring people who have fallen in the assaults led by Bârshud II. She would like your help in gathering stories from displaced warriors and citizens nearby.\n2\tReturn to Zamína with the stories\tReturn to Zamína with the stories you have gathered from the people in Iridír.\n",
[8451]="7005F862\n1\tTalk to Hermáth Stormhammer and witness 'Memories of Máttugard'\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Zidir-nesad, the Steepset. Hermáth Stormhammer has offered to tell you his tale of the siege of Máttugard during the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n2\tTalk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Zidir-nesad\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Zidir-nesad, the Steepset. You have listened to Hermáth Stormhammer's tale of the siege of Máttugard. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n",
[8452]="70041866\n1\tRecover Gondorian heirlooms from Ethillorn (total: 8)\tHeirlooms can be found throughout the ruins of Ethillorn in western Lower Lebennin. You have discovered heirlooms uncovered by the Corsairs in Ethillorn. You should gather them and bring them to Sarnhad until Ethillorn is reclaimed.\n2\tStore the heirlooms in a cache at Sarnhad\tA cache can be found near one of the homes in Sarnhad in western Lower Lebennin. You have gathered all of the heirlooms you could find and should now store them in Sarnhad until Ethillorn can be reclaimed.\n3\tTalk to Erianir\tErianir can be found in Sarnhad in western Lower Lebennin. You have stored the heirlooms and should inform Erianir of what you have done for the people of Ethillorn.\n",
[8453]="70047BEE\n1\tTalk to Elrohir\tElrohir can be found at Haerondir. Elladan and Elrohir have offered to tell a tale of a great victory over the Enemy. You should speak to Elrohir when you are ready to hear the tale.\n2\tTalk to Elrohir at Haerondir\tElrohir can be found at Haerondir. Elladan and Elrohir have finished their tale of the Battle of Dagorlad. You should now speak to Elrohir.\n",
[8454]="7000C37D\n1\tDefeat Wargs in Goblin-town (total: 12)\tThere are Wargs in the tunnels of Goblin-town, to the north-east of Glóin's camp. Glóin explained that, though he cannot decipher the full meaning of the documents you found, there is something sinister within. Seeing only a name and the word for Wargs, he sent you back into the depths of Goblin-town in search of the Wargs allied with the goblins.\n2\tTalk to Glóin at his camp outside of Goblin-town\tGlóin is at his camp outside the entrance of Goblin-town. Entering Goblin-town, you found your way into the many twisting tunnels and defeated many Wargs. You found goblin-keepers with the Wargs, which may interest Glóin.\n",
[8455]="700244F6\n1\tDeliver the blackened carapaces to Second-watcher Heathstraw\030Collect blackened carapaces (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with finding blackened carapaces from insects and spiders in the Barrow-downs and Old Forest. Second-watcher Heathstraw awaits the delivery of these items at the Boar Fountain in Bree.\n",
[8456]="700244EC\n1\tDeliver the blackened filth to Second-watcher Heathstraw\030Collect blackened filth (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with finding blackened filth from the weaker insects, spiders, and Neekerbreekers making Bree-land their home. Second-watcher Heathstraw awaits the delivery of these items at the Boar Fountain in Bree.\n",
[8457]="700244F1\n1\tDeliver the blackened furs to Second-watcher Heathstraw\030Collect blackened furs (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with finding blackened fur from the stronger beasts within Bree-land. Second-watcher Heathstraw awaits the delivery of these items at the Boar Fountain in Bree.\n",
